Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(shader): keep the f32 floor and ceil flush where the
 device flushes by default

NVIDIA's proprietary driver flushes f32 add, multiply and fma denormals by default but not the inputs of floor and ceil, so its startup probe failed only on those two. Drop their software flush only where the device declares DenormFlushToZero 32.
---
